2VME20","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n うん、なんか違和感。\n \n 夏休みは\n すっぴんか\n メイクさんのメイクで\n 過ごすことが多くて\n 濃い化粧が変に感じました（笑）\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYH9AT028K35365QC2WDQB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 寝不足で眠すぎて\n あたまがぼ〜〜〜〜\n \n \n \n 今までの化粧が違和感に感じるのは\n 夏休みの間に\n 少しはアイドルらしくなったってこと？かな？\n \n \n \n ああ〜〜\n 自分でもナチュラルメイクが\n できるようになりたい。\n \n 手先が不器用だから\n 上手にメイクができません。\n \n \n \n \n またねー。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-4067":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ディズニーの曲を聴きながら寝るのにハマっています(*'-'*)ﾉ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうすると夢にケーキとかお城とかが出てくるんですヾ(´︶`♡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニー行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のオススメは、、\nリトルマーメイドの『Part of your would』\nアナと雪の女王の『とびら開けて』\nリロ&スティッチの『アロハ・エ・コモ・マイ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です٩(●˙▿˙●)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてみてね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとも最近ディズニー行きたいね〜ってよく話します(*´﹃`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会まだまだ応募してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は8月4日15:00〜です( ´ー`)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きてね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH97F00XG2Y201QDKV7NQPQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゆ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16157":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようバケラッタ♪♪"},{"type":"br